{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOB RECRUITMENT: FOREST OFFICER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Payment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>$500 / Night Shift</strong><br><i>Terms &amp; Conditions: Only valid if employee survives the entire shift.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Description:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance</strong>: Monitor all forest cameras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense</strong>: Prevent cannibals from breaching cabin gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding Duty</strong>: Deliver \u201cFOOD\u201d into the well whenever you hear crying.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Duties:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair security systems during interference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor generator power and refill fuel as needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>UV flashlight</strong> to repel cannibals \u2014 their skin burns under it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skills Required:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic computer knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prior experience with horror games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to carry heavy packages (<i>bodies</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must not be afraid of the dark\u2026 <i>too much</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cannibal Behavior Report:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cannibal follows a different path to approach you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>hide in the dark</strong> (use your flashlight).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>lurk beneath cameras</strong> (listen for breathing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>sabotage cameras and other systems.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more\u2026</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This job contract is <strong>legally and spiritually binding.</strong><br>Resignation before completing the <strong>3-night shift</strong> is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i><strong>If you fail to feed the cannibals, then you need to feed yourself.</strong></i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Death by Minotaur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/0b5446d93637367b471cb9e68fabef683aaac5b5.jpg"},{"name":"Death by Jaw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/89c710ddb380f8af27e2d5a63ec06c6c6a9da5b9.jpg"},{"name":"Death by Omen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/fe2b720be34d6458d3c84f1ceed32b641f116e10.jpg"},{"name":"Death by Hollowhart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/a53b993ae1da91693c59e5a3a0a3ca15ef2ade9a.jpg"},{"name":"Death by Snare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/69b588f4f51e10b3a5710c9690cedf77a20f5a31.jpg"},{"name":"Feed Cannibal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/373bf649197983b317ab3978e928dc392803cd24.jpg"},{"name":"Job done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/af552e4ba3ff3b2a721dca2d6ca7f38c983c7293.jpg"},{"name":"Knowledge++","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/4a1b861e30559591170476e39f7fc9097a9afe0e.jpg"},{"name":"Blackout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/56a706be8ac7a5c787995f26d16e06304323952d.jpg"},{"name":"Death By Butcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4030650/cd098